WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.500
When a note changes on two devices, Review now appears where you already work.

00:04.500 --> 00:09.000
ZenNotes combines safe edits and asks only about the words that overlap.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.500
Choose either device, keep both changes, or edit the combined note yourself.

00:13.500 --> 00:18.000
Save once. Sync continues with one clean note and no surprise conflict copy.
